  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. PowerToys has no built-in way to colour files or folders in File Explorer yet. The maintainers closed the earlier requests as duplicates. #34349 (file and folder colorize/highlight) and the other recent folder-icon requests were closed in favour of #41964 (folder icon/color change), which is where the request is tracked. Older requests such as #22756 and #6157 were closed as duplicates of earlier tracking issues. Please don't open a new request. Add a 👍 or your use case to #41964 and follow it for updates. Until the feature exists, you'll need a third-party tool, or you can change folder icons manually through Properties > Customize."
